TI  - Attending to Breath: Exploring how the cues in a virtual environment guide the attention to breath and shape the quality of experience to support mindfulness
PY  - 2018
T2  - DIS 2018 - Proceedings of the 2018 Designing Interactive Systems Conference
SP  - 71
EP  - 84
PB  - Association for Computing Machinery
