TI  - DeepTaste: Augmented reality gustatory manipulation with GAN-based real-time food-to-food translation
PY  - 2019
T2  - Proceedings - 2019 IEEE International Symposium on Mixed and Augmented Reality, ISMAR 2019
SP  - 212
EP  - 223
