AB  - Image inpainting aims to restore texture of missing regions in scene from an RGB image. In this paper, we aim to restore not only the texture but also the geometry of the missing regions in scene from a pair of RGB and depth images. Inspired by the recent development of generative adversarial network, we employ an encoder-decoderbased generative adversarial network with the input of RGB and depth image. The experimental results show that our method restores the missing region of both RGB and depth image. © 2019 IEEE.
