AB  - Virtual environments offer the potential to train people for facing complex professional situations. A particularly interesting training context for virtual reality is when such situations involve risk taking and are potentially dangerous for human life. We are specifically interested in training commanding air force officers for military operations. Military training typically involves putting the learner in settings close to the field situation (simulation-based training). In order to facilitate the training we use a new model to orchestrate a generative scenario model maintaining both narrative coherence and control of pedagogical settings of the simulation. © 2022 IEEE.
