TI  - Spacify A Generative Framework for Spatial Comprehension, Articulation and Visualization using Large Language Models (LLMs) and eXtended Reality (XR)
PY  - 2023
T2  - Habits of the Anthropocene: Scarcity and Abundance in a Post-Material Economy - Proceedings of the 43rd Annual Conference of the Association for Computer Aided Design in Architecture, ACADIA 2023
VL  - 2
SP  - 430
