TI  - Scientific and Fantastical: Creating Immersive, Culturally-Relevant Learning Experiences with Augmented Reality and Large Language Models
PY  - 2024
T2  - Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems - Proceedings
PB  - Association for Computing Machinery
