TI  - Advancing Cybersickness Prediction in Immersive Virtual Reality Using Pre-Trained Large Foundation Models
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 IEEE Conference on Virtual Reality and 3D User Interfaces Abstracts and Workshops, VRW 2025
SP  - 1244
