TI  - ConversAR: Exploring Embodied LLM-Powered Group Conversations in Augmented Reality for Second Language Learners
PY  - 2025
T2  - Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems - Proceedings
PB  - Association for Computing Machinery
DO  - 10.1145/3706599.3720162
