TI  - Dreamcrafter: Immersive Editing of 3D Radiance Fields Through Flexible, Generative Inputs and Outputs
PY  - 2025
T2  - Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems - Proceedings
PB  - Association for Computing Machinery
DO  - 10.1145/3706598.3714312
