AB  - FluXkin is a virtual fashion brand exploring the unique visual expressions of digital garments and their role in informational spaces, NFTs, and interdisciplinary integration through XR technologies. In virtual environments, clothing becomes an extension of the body-fluid like skin, responsive to surroundings and internal states. This report documents generative patterns, parametric designs, and speculative concepts for functional virtual fashion in future digital spaces. We also examine its integration with existing XR fashion ecosystems. Looking ahead, we envision a future where digital “skin” stores and transmits information, adapting to environmental and cognitive changes, reshaping human interactions. © The Author(s), under exclusive license to Springer Nature Switzerland AG 2025.
