AB  - In recent years, the field of Artificial Intelligence Generated Content (AIGC) has made impressive progress, especially in 3Dcontent generation.3D content generation has not only attracted alot of attention in academia, but also shows great potential in practical applications, while posing a series of technological challenges. Advancements in AIGC-3D technology are profoundly changing the way games, movies, and virtual reality content are produced. The way of making games, movies, and virtual reality content. In this study, we aim to provide a comprehensive overview of recent advances in the field of 3D generation methods over the past period, covering all aspects from basic 3Drepresentations to cutting-edge generation techniques, and practical applications. This review aims to provide researchers with a structured perspective for a deeper understanding of the current state and future potential of 3D content generation. © 2025, John Wiley and Sons Inc. All rights reserved.
