AB  - A creator's play is never done. Our Hybrid Dance Xplorations workshop invites you to play with us as we adventurously explore virtual camera control, motion capture, generative AI, touchless or gesture-based interaction, and potentially clothing/costume design & simulation - in evolving configurations of our XR/AI sandbox for co-creation and hybrid performance. We will share previous and present work including three use/play cases for movement-based experiences with contemporary dance and salsa (solo, pairs and rueda). Presenters include local artists, researchers and technologists. A highlight will be engaging group activities for workshop attendees to contribute to ideas, laughter and ambitions to date. © 2025 Copyright held by the owner/author(s).
