TI  - Please Let Me Think: The Influence of Conversational Fillers on Transparency and Perception of Waiting Time when Interacting with a Conversational AI in Virtual Reality
PY  - 2025
T2  - ICMI 2025 - Proceedings of the 27th International Conference on Multimodal Interaction
SP  - 496
