AB  - TouchStar is an immersive VR interactive film integrating generative artificial intelligence technologies. It tells the story of a visually impaired girl who rediscovers her dreams in darkness. Built on gesture and voice input, the film incorporates four generative AI modalities - environment, sound, 3D models, and dialogue - enabling dynamic multimodal generation at key narrative points. Real-time feedback to user behavior and story progression supports a personalized narrative system, showcasing the creative and expressive potential of generative AI in VR storytelling. ©2025 Copyright held by the owner/author(s).
