AB  - Math Gesture AI is a unique, artificial intelligence-based gesture recognition application that converts live hand gestures to mathematical functions. Math Gesture AI utilizes state-of-the-art machine learning frameworks such as Tensorflow and computer vision techniques from OpenCV to provide a novel way to interact with technology. It is an interactive and user-friendly platform that recognizes hand gestures for drawing, erasing, and complex math problem-solving using AI models like the Google Generative AI model. The tool is also cross platform, which means it can be used by a large variety of users. This report describes the project development, implementation and outcomes along with challenges faced and future improvements. © 2025 IEEE.
