TI  - Contextual Recovery: Guiding Hand Tracking Failures Recovery in Mixed Reality via VLM Reasoning
PY  - 2026
T2  - Proceedings - 2026 IEEE Conference on Virtual Reality and 3D User Interfaces Abstracts and Workshops, VRW 2026
SP  - 368
EP  - 372
DO  - 10.1109/VRW70859.2026.00072
