AB  - Reframe is a multiplayer virtual reality experience where groups collectively edit 360° photographic environments using generative AI. Participants inhabit an immersive 360° or panoramic image and point at areas they wish to modify. They then speak together about what they want to see, and the system transcribes and summarizes their dialogue into a prompt. AI imagery is subsequently composited into the selected area. Building on prior research documenting how collaborative storytelling emerges through voice-based interaction with panoramic imagery, Reframe translates these affordances into a portable VR installation. The result invites participants to treat the panorama as an archive for remembering or a canvas for exploration.Supplementary Video: https://youtu.be/oBRH6CAxUgk
